@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@assignmentId = 1

### 1. Lay danh sach bai tap (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/assignments
Accept: application/json

### 2. Bai tap khong ton tai (404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/assignments/9999
Accept: application/json

### 3. Nop bai thanh cong (201), luu ID tu response
# @name createSubmission
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/assignments/{{assignmentId}}/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV002",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/student/edusubmit"
}

### 4. Doc lai luot nop vua tao (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/submissions/{{createSubmission.response.body.$.id}}
Accept: application/json

### 5. Nop bai thieu truong du lieu (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/assignments/{{assignmentId}}/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "",
  "repositoryUrl": ""
}

### 6. Nop bai vao bai tap da dong (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/assignments/3/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV002",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/student/edusubmit"
}

### 7. Thieu Content-Type (415)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/assignments/{{assignmentId}}/submissions

{
  "studentCode": "SV002",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/student/edusubmit"
}